<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21081" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βρόχος</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>noose, slip-knot</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				11.278
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				22.472
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.60
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Democr.
				134
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				1222
			</span></i>, etc.; <i>snare for birds</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Av.</u>
				527
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θηρῶν β.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hel.</u>
					1169
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁλοὺς βρόχων πλεκταῖς ἀνάγκαις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Xenarch.
					1.8
				</span></i>
			; <i>mesh</i> of a net, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyn.</u>
				2.5
			</span></i>, etc.: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">β. ἀρκύων ξιφηφόροι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>HF</u>
					729
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡς ἂν ληφθῶσιν ἐν ταὐτῷ βρόχῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ch.</u>
					557
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν βρόχῳ τὸν τράχηλον ἔχων
				νομοθετεῖν</span> 'with <i>a halter</i> round one's neck',
				<i><span class="en">
				D.
				24.139
			</span></i>. (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βρόκχον</span> shd. be written
			in <i><span class="en">
				Thgn.
				1099
			</span></i>.)</div>
